@page "/counter"

<PageTitle>Counter · BlazorTools</PageTitle>

<h3>Counter</h3>

<p class="page-note">
    Blazor 模板自带的示例页，用来验证事件绑定与增量渲染：每次点击只更新这一个计数节点，不会重建整页。
</p>

<div class="panel">
    <div class="panel-head">
        <span class="panel-title">计数器 Count</span>
        <span class="panel-sub">点一次 +1</span>
    </div>

    <div class="metric-grid is-single">
        <div class="metric is-hi">
            <div class="metric-k">Current count</div>
            <div class="metric-v v-count">@currentCount</div>
            <div class="metric-hint">状态保存在组件实例里，离开页面即重置</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-row">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="IncrementCount">Click me</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn" @onclick="() => currentCount = 0">归零 Reset</button>
    </div>
</div>

@code {
    private int currentCount = 0;

    private void IncrementCount()
    {
        currentCount++;
    }
}
